{"seq":3,"slug":"effect-size-power-meta","title":"效应量、功效与元分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/research-methods-open-science/measurement-data/effect-size-power-meta","wordCount":1410,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"效应量-功效与元分析\">效应量、功效与元分析</h1><p>「两组有显著差异」是一句几乎不传递信息的话——差异可能大到改变人生，也可能小到毫无实际意义，而 p 值对此守口如瓶。这一篇要把视角从「有没有」抬升到「有多大」「我有多大把握发现它」「全世界的研究合起来说明什么」。它直接补上 <a href=\"sampling-statistical-inference\">抽样与统计推断</a> 里 NHST 留下的三个窟窿，是从单项研究走向证据累积的关键一跃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>效应量、统计功效与样本量构成一个相互锁定的三角，再加上显著性水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，四者一旦定下三个，第四个就被决定了。这是研究设计阶段最实用的数量关系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[显著性水平 α&lt;br/&gt;通常0.05] --&gt; POW[统计功效分析]&#10;  ES[效应量&lt;br/&gt;预期效应多大] --&gt; POW&#10;  N[样本量 n] --&gt; POW&#10;  POW --&gt; P[功效 1-β&lt;br/&gt;侦测到真效应的概率]&#10;  P -.锁定其三求其四.-&gt; A&#10;  P -.-&gt; ES&#10;  P -.-&gt; N\">flowchart TD\n  A[显著性水平 α&lt;br/&gt;通常0.05] --&gt; POW[统计功效分析]\n  ES[效应量&lt;br/&gt;预期效应多大] --&gt; POW\n  N[样本量 n] --&gt; POW\n  POW --&gt; P[功效 1-β&lt;br/&gt;侦测到真效应的概率]\n  P -.锁定其三求其四.-&gt; A\n  P -.-&gt; ES\n  P -.-&gt; N</pre><p>下表汇总最常用的效应量指标，它们的共同特点是与样本量无关——这正是它们优于 p 值之处。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>常见小/中/大基准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cohen&#39;s <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>两组均值差</td>\n<td>0.2 / 0.5 / 0.8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pearson <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>两连续变量关联</td>\n<td>0.1 / 0.3 / 0.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>方差分析解释比例</td>\n<td>0.01 / 0.06 / 0.14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Odds Ratio</td>\n<td>二分结果</td>\n<td>视领域而定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cohen-s-d-与效应量的解读\">Cohen&#39;s d 与效应量的解读</h2><p>最常见的均值差效应量 Cohen&#39;s <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，把两组均值之差用合并标准差标准化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\frac{\\bar{X}_1 - \\bar{X}_2}{s_{pooled}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4692em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4971em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的妙处在于无量纲：无论原始测量用的是秒、分还是次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 都意味着两组均值相差半个标准差。但 Cohen 本人反复强调，0.2/0.5/0.8 的小中大基准只是无背景时的应急参照，绝不能机械套用——在生死攸关的医学干预里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 可能极其重要，而在某些领域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 也未必有实际价值。效应量必须放回具体语境去解读。</p>\n<p>效应量与上一篇的测量层次紧密相关：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 适用于连续变量，而当变量测量不可靠时，<a href=\"measurement-reliability-validity\">测量、信度与效度</a> 提到的衰减效应会系统性地压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的观测值。报告效应量及其置信区间，而非仅报告 p 值，是当代方法学改革的核心诉求之一，也是 <a href=\"../replication-open-science/open-science-practices\">开放科学实践</a> 推动的报告规范。</p>\n<h2 id=\"统计功效与样本量规划\">统计功效与样本量规划</h2><p>统计功效是「当真实效应存在时，研究侦测到它的概率」，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - \\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是第二类错误（漏报真效应）的概率。学界惯例把 0.80 当作可接受的下限——意味着即使效应真实存在，仍有两成概率因运气不佳而漏掉。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  T[现实:效应真的存在吗] --&gt; TE[存在]&#10;  T --&gt; TN[不存在]&#10;  TE --&gt; P1[检出:正确&lt;br/&gt;功效 1-β]&#10;  TE --&gt; P2[漏检:第二类错误 β]&#10;  TN --&gt; P3[误报:第一类错误 α]&#10;  TN --&gt; P4[未报:正确]\">graph TD\n  T[现实:效应真的存在吗] --&gt; TE[存在]\n  T --&gt; TN[不存在]\n  TE --&gt; P1[检出:正确&lt;br/&gt;功效 1-β]\n  TE --&gt; P2[漏检:第二类错误 β]\n  TN --&gt; P3[误报:第一类错误 α]\n  TN --&gt; P4[未报:正确]</pre><p>功效不足是心理学的慢性病。一项针对学科文献的著名估计显示，许多领域研究的平均功效远低于 0.50，意味着多数研究即便假设为真也大概率检不出。功效低有两个连锁恶果：一是漏报真效应；二是更隐蔽的——在低功效下侥幸「显著」的结果，其效应量往往被严重高估（赢家诅咒），因为只有偶然偏大的估计才越过了显著线。这正是 <a href=\"../replication-open-science/replication-crisis\">复制危机</a> 中原始研究效应在复制时大幅缩水的统计机制。事前做功效分析、据预期效应量算出所需样本量，是预注册时的标准动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"元分析-把研究合起来读\">元分析：把研究合起来读</h2><p>单项研究像一次抽样，难免抖动；元分析则把同一问题下的众多研究系统地合并，得到更稳的总效应估计。它的核心做法是对各研究的效应量加权平均，权重通常取方差倒数——样本大、估计精的研究说话更响。</p>\n<p>元分析的威力伴随两个致命弱点。其一是「垃圾进、垃圾出」：若纳入的原始研究本身有偏（如测量不可靠、设计糟糕），合并只会把偏差精确化。其二是发表偏倚——显著结果更容易被发表，抽屉里躺着大量未发表的零结果，于是文献库本身就是一个被筛选过的有偏样本，元分析据此得出的总效应会系统性偏大。</p>\n<p>检测发表偏倚的常用工具是漏斗图与 Egger 检验：在无偏情况下，小样本研究的效应应对称地散在大样本研究两侧，若一侧明显缺失（缺失的正是不显著的小研究），就提示发表偏倚。p-hacking 与发表偏倚会交互作用、共同扭曲元分析的效应估计，这是 <a href=\"../replication-open-science/replication-crisis\">复制危机</a> 中讨论的核心病理。正因如此，前瞻性的、纳入预注册研究的元分析，被视为最可信的证据形式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>效应量、功效、样本量与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 构成相互锁定的四角，定下其三即决定第四，是设计阶段最实用的数量关系。</li>\n<li>Cohen&#39;s <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 把均值差标准化为无量纲量，但小中大基准只是应急参照，效应量必须放回具体语境解读。</li>\n<li>统计功效是侦测真效应的概率，惯例下限 0.80；功效不足既漏报真效应，又导致侥幸显著结果的效应被高估。</li>\n<li>元分析靠方差倒数加权合并众多研究得到更稳估计，但受「垃圾进垃圾出」与发表偏倚两大威胁。</li>\n<li>漏斗图与 Egger 检验可探测发表偏倚；纳入预注册研究的前瞻性元分析是最可信的证据形式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"效应量、功效与元分析","id":"效应量-功效与元分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Cohen's d 与效应量的解读","id":"cohen-s-d-与效应量的解读"},{"level":2,"text":"统计功效与样本量规划","id":"统计功效与样本量规划"},{"level":2,"text":"元分析：把研究合起来读","id":"元分析-把研究合起来读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"抽样与统计推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/research-methods-open-science/measurement-data/sampling-statistical-inference"},"next":{"title":"质性研究方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/research-methods-open-science/qualitative-mixed-ethics/qualitative-methods"}}